Hello {!Contact.FirstName}

We expect the upcoming FCC regulations requiring 1:1 consent to have impacts on the lead industry. Our testing suggests lead volume could decrease by ~30%, and conversion rates will increase by ~25-40%.

With this updated dynamic, I want to be sure you remain competitive in our auction so we don’t see disruptions to your lead volume. My goal is to keep your cost per acquisition the same since the increased conversion rates means there will be less marketing and producer costs for each bind. 

I’ll have more exacting numbers on what this means for your pricing before January, in the meantime I’d love to get on a call with you to discuss setting your account up for success for 2025. Here’s my calendar link {!User.Calendar_Link__c} to book directly, or let me know when you’d like to get on a call to catch up!